msgid ""
"The thesis tests only the best feature combination of each algorithm on the "
"test data."
msgstr ""
"Tesis hanya menguji kombinasi fitur terbaik tiap algoritma pada data uji."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Rule-based BaliSentiLex baseline for comparison: F1 CV %(cv)s, F1 test "
