msgid "Satua analysis"
msgstr "Analisis satua"

msgid ""
"The analysis could not be completed because the server did not respond. Your "
"text has not been lost. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Analisis tidak dapat diselesaikan karena server tidak merespons. Teks Anda "
"tidak hilang. Coba lagi."

msgid "Try a sample satua:"
msgstr "Coba contoh satua:"

msgid "Analysing..."
msgstr "Menganalisis..."

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Reset"

msgid "Up to 20,000 characters. Analysis usually takes a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Paling banyak 20.000 karakter. Analisis biasanya selesai dalam beberapa "
"detik."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Analyses left today: %(remaining)s of %(limit)s. Failed analyses are not "
"counted."
msgstr ""
"Sisa kuota hari ini: %(remaining)s dari %(limit)s analisis. Analisis yang "
"gagal tidak dihitung."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have used today's quota of %(limit)s analyses. The quota resets at "
"midnight (WITA). Your history stays available."
msgstr ""
"Kuota hari ini (%(limit)s analisis) sudah habis. Kuota diatur ulang pukul "
"00.00 WITA. Riwayat Anda tetap bisa dibuka."

msgid "Analysing text..."
msgstr "Menganalisis teks..."

msgid "(i) Recognising the characters and their entity labels"
msgstr "(i) Mengenali tokoh dan label entitasnya"

msgid "(ii) Grouping the other names of each character"
msgstr "(ii) Mengelompokkan nama lain setiap tokoh"

msgid "(iii) Classifying each group as protagonist or antagonist"
msgstr ""
"(iii) Mengklasifikasi setiap kelompok sebagai protagonis atau antagonis"

msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Coba lagi"

msgid "No analysis yet. Paste a satua text to begin."
msgstr "Belum ada analisis. Tempel teks satua untuk memulai."

